  "body": "This release provides binaries based on [Maven 3.9.16](https://maven.apache.org/docs/3.9.16/release-notes.html).\r\n\r\nDownloads:\r\nhttps://downloads.apache.org/maven/mvnd/1.0.6/\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Bump testcontainers.version from 2.0.3 to 2.0.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1568\r\n* Bump groovy.version from 5.0.4 to 5.0.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1576\r\n* Bump org.graalvm.buildtools:native-maven-plugin from 0.11.5 to 1.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1577\r\n* Bump maven.version from 3.9.14 to 3.9.15 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1585\r\n* Bump org.javassist:javassist from 3.30.2-GA to 3.31.0-GA by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1588\r\n* Bump org.graalvm.buildtools:native-maven-plugin from 1.0.0 to 1.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1594\r\n* Bump org.graalvm.nativeimage:svm from 25.0.2 to 25.0.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1592\r\n* Bump testcontainers.version from 2.0.4 to 2.0.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1590\r\n* Bump groovy.version from 5.0.5 to 5.0.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1605\r\n* Bump org.apache.maven:maven-parent from 47 to 48 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1608\r\n* Bump maven.version from 3.9.15 to 3.9.16 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1615\r\n* [1.x] Pin graalvm/setup-graalvm to ASF-allowed commit hash by @gnodet in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1612\r\n* [1.x] Minor updates and align JUnit by @cstamas in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1610\r\n* Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-site-plugin from 3.21.0 to 3.22.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/pull/1621\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/apache/maven-mvnd/compare/1.0.5...1.0.6",
